{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbExciting train driving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A world where open tracks with various situations and a physically simulated driving sensation are connected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbPhysical simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is not a system that runs on a predetermined line. The feature of this game is that the wheels actually roll and run on the rails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbSettings and missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a train driver supporting the growth of the emerging city-state &quot;Chamland Republic&quot; that is developing in the mountainous region. Complete missions and contribute to the development of the country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbCooperative system that loosely connects with others</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cooperate with other players through contribution points and achieve common goals.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897310?t=1754212706","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897310?t=1754212706","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897310/a8c654465660e1c6e7f5d207d603376454705620/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754212706","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897310/a8c654465660e1c6e7f5d207d603376454705620/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754212706","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbExciting train driving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A world where open tracks with various situations and a physically simulated driving sensation are connected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbPhysical simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is not a system that runs on a predetermined line. The feature of this game is that the wheels actually roll and run on the rails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbSettings and missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a train driver supporting the growth of the emerging city-state &quot;Chamland Republic&quot; that is developing in the mountainous region. Complete missions and contribute to the development of the country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbCooperative system that loosely connects with others</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cooperate with other players through contribution points and achieve common goals.</p>","developers":["Cham."],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897310/cb680b346e636857531770bdb6ccdfc5c00f240a/header.jpg?t=1754212706","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257177472,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257177472/movie480.mp4?t=1754212703","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257177472/movie_max.mp4?t=1754212703"},"name":"In-game video","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257177472/76831bbd525cfaa10de2aaa1db91342ee00c0c90/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754212703","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257177472/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754212703","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257177472/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1754212703"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257172794,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tr